      "id": "PGU-01",
      "chapter": "global",
      "anchor": "global-parabolic-modulus-shape",
      "title": "Subalgebra Haar asymptotics, conjugation modulus on the isotropic nilradical, and parabolic integral factorization",
      "hypotheses": "The real unitary group G = U(p, q) (n = p + q) with Hilbert–Schmidt norm ‖X‖_HS = (Re tr(X X*))^(1/2); a real multiplication-closed subspace A ⊆ M_n(ℂ) defining S = {g ∈ G : g − 1 ∈ A} with Hilbert–Schmidt orthonormal real basis E₁, …, E_d of A ∩ Lie(G) and d-gauge left-S-invariant Borel measure μ; a totally isotropic flag 0 = W₀ ⊂ W₁ ⊂ ⋯ ⊂ W_a of positive rank jumps j₁, …, j_a ≥ 1 (J = ∑ j_i ≤ min(p, q)) with unipotent radical N, self-adjoint Levi subgroup M, maximal compact subgroup K, unimodular σ-finite Haar measure μ_G, nonzero left Haar measures μ_N, μ_M finite on compacts, and probability Haar measure μ_K.",
      "statement": "Any d-gauge left-S-invariant Borel measure μ on S is σ-finite, finite on compact sets, and unique, and satisfies r^(−d) ∫_{‖g−1‖_HS < √r₁} φ(t(g)/r) dμ(g) → ∫_{ℝ^d} φ(t) dt as r → 0⁺ for all 0 < r₁ ≤ r₀ and continuous compactly supported φ : ℝ^d → ℝ; conjugation T(u) = m u m⁻¹ by any m ∈ G normalizing S (m S m⁻¹ = S) with Ad(m)(E_k) = ∑_i L_{ik} E_i (det L ≠ 0) pushes μ forward to |det L|⁻¹ μ; on the isotropic flag nilradical, dim_ℝ N = d_N = 2J² − ∑ j_i² + 2J(n − 2J) and (u ↦ m u m⁻¹)_* μ_N = δ(m) μ_N with measurable modulus δ(m) = |det_ℝ(Ad(m)|_{Lie(N)})|⁻¹ = P₁(s) at s_i = (D_i/D_{i−1})^(−1/j_i); and there exists 0 < κ < ∞ such that ∫_G φ(g) dμ_G(g) = κ ∫_N ∫_M δ(m) ∫_K φ(u m k) dμ_K(k) dμ_M(m) dμ_N(u) for every nonnegative measurable φ.",
      "definitions": [
        "matrix-algebra subgroup S = {g ∈ G : g − 1 ∈ A} with tangent coordinate map t_i(g) = Re tr((g − 1) E_i*)",
        "self-dual (2a + 1)-step flag completion F_s = W_s and F_{2a+1−s} = W_s^⊥ (0 ≤ s ≤ a) with subspace determinants D_s = |det_ℂ(m|_{F_s})| = D_{2a+1−s}",
        "compact-set conjugation ratio δ(m) = μ_N(m⁻¹ C m) / μ_N(C) for 0 < μ_N(C) < ∞"
      ],
      "equations": [
        "global-parabolic-subalgebra-asymptotic-eq",
